# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. The lensing-server loads .env at
# startup (dotenvy).

# --- Spotify Web API (corpus enrich) ---
# The corpus-build pipeline's `enrich` step (pipeline/refresh_corpus.sh) fetches
# track/artist metadata for newly ingested tracks via the Spotify Web API
# client-credentials flow. Create an app at
# https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard and copy its Client ID + Secret here.
